              "text": "DestroyScope",
              "kind": "type"
            }
          ],
          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Scope that owns the job for as long as it runs: the scheduler tracks the job in it on run and untracks it again when the job settles, so a scene or screen that is destroyed mid-job cancels it without collecting every finished job it ever started."
        }
